---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms — DekhoYahan"
  description="Simple terms for using DekhoYahan."
>
  <section class="content-page shell">
    <p class="section-kicker">Terms</p>

    <h1>
      A few simple
      <em>ground rules.</em>
    </h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        DekhoYahan exists to help people understand technology and the world around them more clearly.
        You are welcome to explore the site and share what you find useful.
      </p>

      <h2>Using DekhoYahan</h2>

      <p>
        You may browse DekhoYahan and share links to our pages and explanations.
      </p>

      <p>
        Please do not misuse the site, try to disrupt or damage it, bypass its security,
        or use it in a way that harms other people.
      </p>

      <h2>Our content</h2>

      <p>
        You are welcome to quote or share small parts of DekhoYahan when it is reasonable
        to do so and you make it clear where they came from.
      </p>

      <p>
        Please do not copy, reproduce, or republish substantial parts of our explanations,
        writing, illustrations, interactions, or other original work as your own.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy</h2>

      <p>
        We try to research, review, and explain things carefully. Technology changes,
        information can become outdated, and mistakes are still possible.
      </p>

      <p>
        DekhoYahan is provided for general information, education, and understanding.
        It should not be treated as legal, medical, financial, security, or other
        professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Ideas from the community</h2>

      <p>
        From time to time, people may suggest topics, ideas, examples, or questions
        for DekhoYahan to explore.
      </p>

      <p>
        Sending us an idea does not guarantee that we will publish it.
        If an idea helps inspire something we create, we may research it, develop it,
        and explain it in our own way.
      </p>

      <h2>Other websites</h2>

      <p>
        We may sometimes link to other websites or sources because they are useful
        for understanding a topic. We do not control those websites or their content.
      </p>

      <h2>DekhoYahan will change</h2>

      <p>
        The project is still growing. We may improve, update, remove, or add explanations
        and features as we learn what is useful.
      </p>

      <p>
        If these terms need to change as DekhoYahan grows, we will update this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>

      <p>
        If you have a question about these terms, email
        <a href="mailto:hello@dekhoyahan.com">hello@dekhoyahan.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Last updated:</strong> 14 August 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>